+// REWINDBOX_GUEST_ACCESS_FP_LR_636: a register the handler may read or write through the context. Darwin's
+// thread state holds X0-X28 in __x[29]; X29 (FP) and X30 (LR) are separate fields, so GPR(context, 29/30)
